# dev_artifacts convention

**CONFORMANCE.md**, **README-AOMI.md**, and similar collaborator/dev docs belong in **`dev_artifacts/`**, not the repository root.

Deploy and packaging can delete or ignore root-level docs. Keep them under `dev_artifacts/` (gitignored except the versioned doc files).

- Edit: `dev_artifacts/CONFORMANCE.md`, `dev_artifacts/README-AOMI.md`
- Do **not** recreate these at repo root
- Point links from `README.md` to `dev_artifacts/README-AOMI.md`
- Design notes, runbooks, and local-only collateral also go in `dev_artifacts/`
